{"t":"Fibula Tunnel","s":"fibula-tunnel-dbba4","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Fibula_Tunnel_ef410c.png","q":6,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Fibula Tunnel</b> is a tunnel connection between the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">mainland of Tibia</a> and the island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula\">Fibula</a>. It consists of five small caves, which are all but the lowest one artificially lit. The lowest of the caves only consists of a single platform surrounded by <a href=\"#/wiki/Lava\">lava</a> instead of walls and is therefore naturally lit. The two highest floors of the tunnel are inhabited by some <a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\">Cave Rats</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"25eeed004bafd93a70581ad70a0fabbd\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Fibula_Tunnel-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"The mainland entrance\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The mainland entrance\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fibula_Tunnel_ef410c.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Fibula Tunnel.png (800 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The mainland entrance</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Fibula_Tunnel_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"The lowest floor\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The lowest floor\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fibula_Tunnel_2_a57d59.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Fibula Tunnel 2.png (561 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The lowest floor</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\"><img alt=\"Cave Rat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cave_Rat_f0f59a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Rat\">Cave Rat</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">10 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\">Worm</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookie</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["beggar-outfits-quest","deeper-fibula-quest","the-great-expedition","the-postman-missions-quest","the-secret-library-quest","what-a-fo